{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It has been over a month since your partner Maria Randers disappeared. You're suspicious that she's stuck in the dark, mysterious Str\u00fcvat Laboratories.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the hazardous lab with the help of unique <strong>audio-based equipment</strong> such as: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u29bf Echolocation sonar guns\u00a0 <br>\u00a0\u29bf Pulse grenades <br>\u00a0\u29bf Speaking object identifiers <br>\u00a0\u29bf Rangefinders </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/67a0006a25db6785223f16cb6a30081e.avif?t=1757615803\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what happened in 2005 by reading hidden <strong>documents</strong> and badges. Learn about the employees and methods of the lab, and maybe catch a hint of the unsettling elevator music playing in the cafeteria. Or was the sound... <strong>something else?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/90ad3530e2c08b49ed4bf8a890eaec50.avif?t=1757615803\" alt=\"icon showing sonar sound sweeping\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sounds Terrifying is a blind-accessible mystery horror game tested by people with all sight levels. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It plays similar to an FPS with short-range graphics, minigames, and an emphasis on spatial audio for headphones and unique methods of audio navigation. There are options to remove the graphics, play with keyboard, play peacefully, or change the text to speech mode, rate, volume, and game difficulty.</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903920?t=1757615803","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903920?t=1757615803","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/ba220c3a4749123265cd3b37eed1db9cac5912a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757615803","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/ba220c3a4749123265cd3b37eed1db9cac5912a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757615803","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It has been over a month since your partner Maria Randers disappeared. You're suspicious that she's stuck in the dark, mysterious Str\u00fcvat Laboratories.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the hazardous lab with the help of unique <strong>audio-based equipment</strong> such as: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u29bf Echolocation sonar guns\u00a0 <br>\u00a0\u29bf Pulse grenades <br>\u00a0\u29bf Speaking object identifiers <br>\u00a0\u29bf Rangefinders </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/67a0006a25db6785223f16cb6a30081e.avif?t=1757615803\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what happened in 2005 by reading hidden <strong>documents</strong> and badges. Learn about the employees and methods of the lab, and maybe catch a hint of the unsettling elevator music playing in the cafeteria. Or was the sound... <strong>something else?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/extras/90ad3530e2c08b49ed4bf8a890eaec50.avif?t=1757615803\" alt=\"icon showing sonar sound sweeping\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sounds Terrifying is a blind-accessible mystery horror game tested by people with all sight levels. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It plays similar to an FPS with short-range graphics, minigames, and an emphasis on spatial audio for headphones and unique methods of audio navigation. There are options to remove the graphics, play with keyboard, play peacefully, or change the text to speech mode, rate, volume, and game difficulty.</strong> </p>","developers":["pyrano studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903920/7e1ec227cddedd8959a1284791b51d34b088bc83/header.jpg?t=1757615803","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184219,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184219/movie480.mp4?t=1755879498","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184219/movie_max.mp4?t=1755879498"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184219/988bb806c9fed1e5cd6e4b79d2d4ab8c735ae282/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755879498","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184219/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755879498","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184219/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755879498"}}],"name":"Sounds Terrifying","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> N